  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, add the water (for the rice) and bring to the boil.\n• Add basmati rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat.\n• Keep covered, until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb4d6553f74890680db51-4643aca0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, cut haloumi into bite-sized chunks. Transfer haloumi to a medium bowl, then add enough water to cover.\n• Roughly chop brown onion. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Finely chop garlic. Drain haloumi, then pat dry.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. When oil is hot, cook haloumi, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb4d6553f74890680db51-8a04f650.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion and carrot, tossing, until golden, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic, tomato paste, Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend (see ingredients) and the honey and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in light cooking cream and the water (for the sauce). Return haloumi to the pan. Simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then stir in the butter, a pinch of pepper and the baby spinach leaves, until spinach is just wilted, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb4d6553f74890680db51-40c697e5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide jasmine rice between bowls. Top with haloumi masala.\n• Garnish with flaked almonds. Tear over coriander leaves to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb4d6553f74890680db51-e94989d0.jpeg"
    }
  ]
